      "html": "<p>The Yellow Seam Plecos or Golden Nuggets of the genus Baryancistrus (L18, L81, L177) are among the most desirable pleco species of all. Young fish look very beautiful. However, almost exclusively young specimens are available in the trade.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/10b-catfishes-suckermouths-plecos-and-l-numbers/baryancistrus_xanthellus_l18_adult_en/",
      "html": "<p>An adult pair was successfully imported. The fish have a total length of about 20-25 cm. Acclimatisation in the fish house caused no problems at all. Perhaps these two Golden Nuggets will become the ancestors of a future aquarium strain.</p><p><strong>Lexicon:</strong> Baryancistrus: ancient Greek, means \"heavy Ancistrus\"; Ancistrus is another genus of catfish. xanthellus (species epithet): ancient Greek, means \"yellow\".</p>"
    }
